{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/bConnectedVertices(from:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Every vertex B-connected to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"b_visit"},{"text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reachability.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is B-connected to ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or some hyperedge with ","type":"text"},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" among its targets is entered along a path","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" is a vertex."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":